text:
@here Friendly reminder that when a vendor contract is TERMINATED that means we TERMINATE the relationship. All of it. Not just the parts that are convenient.

Vendor XYZ is STILL listed as active in our directory, STILL being invited to meetings, and someone even sent them an RFP yesterday for NEW work??

I genuinely cannot understand how this is happening when we have clear protocols. @rachel @kevin need you both in my office at 9am tomorrow to walk me through your interpretation of what "contract termination" means because clearly we're not on the same page.

@channel This is now the THIRD vendor issue this quarter where proper procedure was completely ignored. I'm formally requesting an emergency meeting with leadership because clearly our training isn't working. 

I've archived this entire conversation and will be submitting it as evidence of systematic process failures in our department. Everyone on this thread should probably review the compliance guidelines before our meeting with the executives tomorrow morning.

Someone needs to take ownership of this disaster.
